8.  Acknowledgements
--------------------

Please  note that these menus, are in fact based on the original menus from
Flux  Point  BBS.   But  the only thing remaining from those menus, are the
actual text contained in the menus (the text describing commands etc.).  So
most of this is enterely done by ME, the author.

